{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "rulesetVersion": "osmand-de-2026.10.10",
  "minimumAppVersionCode": 1,
  "createdAt": "2026-10-04T00:00:00Z",
  "publisher": "PebbleNTN maintainers",
  "rules": [
    {
      "id": "osmand-roundabout-street-de",
      "enabled": true,
      "priority": 191,
      "packageNames": [
        "net.osmand",
        "net.osmand.plus",
        "net.osmand.dev",
        "net.osmand.huawei"
      ],
      "locales": [
        "de"
      ],
      "comment": "Variant of osmand-roundabout-de one step above it: road line '2 Ausfahrt L 33 nach Erftstadt' from bigText, so the exit number and the direction show together; the app fits it to the watch's 64 bytes. Only when a road follows 'Ausfahrt'. Shared custom rules (#76).",
      "conditions": [
        {
          "field": "bigText",
          "operator": "regex",
          "value": "(?i)\\bnehmen\\s+sie\\s+die\\s+\\d+\\.?\\s+ausfahrt\\s+(?![\\d.,]+\\s*k?m\\s*(?:\\n|$)).+?\\s+[\\d.,]+\\s*k?m\\s*(?:\\n|$)"
        }
      ],
      "output": {
        "maneuver": {
          "type": "literal",
          "value": "ROUNDABOUT"
        },
        "distanceMeters": {
          "type": "distance",
          "field": "combinedText"
        },
        "primaryText": {
          "type": "regexCapture",
          "field": "bigText",
          "pattern": "(?i)\\bnehmen\\s+sie\\s+die\\s+(\\d+\\.?\\s+ausfahrt\\s+(?![\\d.,]+\\s*k?m\\s*(?:\\n|$))[^\\n]+?)\\s+[\\d.,]+\\s*k?m\\s*(?:\\n|$)",
          "group": 1
        },
        "secondaryText": {
          "type": "regexCapture",
          "field": "bigText",
          "pattern": "(?im)^([\\d.,]+\\s*k?m)\\s*•\\s*(?:\\d+\\s*h(?:\\s*<?\\s*\\d+\\s*min)?|<?\\s*\\d+\\s*min)\\s*•\\s*\\d{1,2}:\\d{2}\\b",
          "group": 1
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "osmand-roundabout-de",
      "enabled": true,
      "priority": 190,
      "packageNames": [
        "net.osmand",
        "net.osmand.plus",
        "net.osmand.dev",
        "net.osmand.huawei"
      ],
      "locales": [
        "de"
      ],
      "comment": "Contributed by a user via \"Share your rules\" (2026-10, #61) and checked against OsmAnd's German strings (OsmAnd/res/values-de/strings.xml): 'Kreisverkehr: Nehmen Sie die %d Ausfahrt, dann' (route_roundabout) and the short forms without 'Kreisverkehr', 'Nehmen Sie die %d Ausfahrt' / '%d. Ausfahrt nehmen' / 'Die %d Ausfahrt nehmen und links halten'. A number before 'Ausfahrt' keeps a plain motorway 'Ausfahrt' out. Above the keep rules, so roundabout+keep stays a roundabout.",
      "conditions": [
        {
          "field": "combinedText",
          "operator": "regex",
          "value": "(?i)\\bKreisverkehr\\b|\\b\\d+\\.?\\s+Ausfahrt\\b"
        }
      ],
      "output": {
        "maneuver": {
          "type": "literal",
          "value": "ROUNDABOUT"
        },
        "distanceMeters": {
          "type": "distance",
          "field": "combinedText"
        },
        "primaryText": {
          "type": "firstNonEmpty",
          "fields": [
            "title",
            "text"
          ],
          "stripLeadingDistance": true
        },
        "secondaryText": {
          "type": "regexCapture",
          "field": "bigText",
          "pattern": "(?im)^([\\d.,]+\\s*k?m)\\s*•\\s*(?:\\d+\\s*h(?:\\s*<?\\s*\\d+\\s*min)?|<?\\s*\\d+\\s*min)\\s*•\\s*\\d{1,2}:\\d{2}\\b",
          "group": 1
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "osmand-uturn-de",
      "enabled": true,
      "priority": 180,
      "packageNames": [
        "net.osmand",
        "net.osmand.plus",
        "net.osmand.dev",
