        "net.osmand.huawei"
      ],
      "locales": [
        "de"
      ],
      "comment": "Variant of osmand-sharp-left-de one step above it: OsmAnd cuts the title at ', dann'; bigText's first line goes on with the next road and its length ('rechts abbiegen, dann B 1 Grunerstraße 400 m'), so the road line shows that road. The app fits it to the watch's 64 bytes. Only when a road follows 'dann'. Shared custom rules (#76).",
